#. module: theme_notes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_notes.s_media_list
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Once again this year, the festival, with the support of the non-"
"profit organisations that implement the necessary means to facilitate access "
"to the event for people with reduced mobility and people affected by or "
"carrying a disability."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Tudi letos festival, s podporo neprofitnih organizacij, ki "
"zagotavljajo potrebna sredstva za olajšanje dostopa do dogodka osebam z "
"zmanjšano mobilnostjo ter osebam, ki jih je prizadela invalidnost ali živijo "
"z njo."

#. module: theme_notes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_notes.s_media_list
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Where and when to exchange your festival bracelets? Where to buy "
"food and drink tickets? What is the price for children? The answer can be "
"found here!"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Kje in kdaj zamenjati festivalske zapestnice? Kje kupiti bone za "
"hrano in pijačo? Kakšna je cena za otroke? Odgovor najdete tukaj!"

#. module: theme_notes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_notes.s_media_list
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        You will find here the different means of transport to get to the "
"festival. The festival is accessible by bike. Be careful, you will be riding "
"in the city centre where there are a lot of cars. Please make sure to park "
"your bike in the designated areas of the city."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Tukaj boste našli različna prevozna sredstva, s katerimi lahko "
"pridete na festival. Do festivala lahko pridete s kolesom. Bodite previdni, "
"saj se boste vozili po mestnem središču, kjer je veliko avtomobilov. "
"Poskrbite, da boste kolo parkirali na za to določenih mestih v mestu."

#. module: theme_notes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_notes.s_empowerment
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Bringing you unforgettable live music and electrifying shows.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Prinašamo vam nepozabno glasbo v živo in elektrizirajoče predstave.<br/>"
"<br/>"

#. module: theme_notes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_notes.s_split_intro
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Join us for live performances that captivate and energize. Our music "
"band brings passion and expertise to every show, delivering a memorable "
"experience with every note. From original compositions to beloved covers, we "
"create a vibrant atmosphere that resonates with fans and keeps the music "
"alive.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Pridružite se nam na nastopih v živo, ki navdušujejo in napolnijo z "
"energijo. Naša glasbena skupina na vsak nastop prinaša strast in strokovno "
"znanje ter z vsako noto ustvari nepozabno doživetje. Od izvirnih skladb do "
"priljubljenih priredb ustvarjamo živahno vzdušje, ki odmeva med oboževalci "
"in ohranja glasbo pri življenju.<br/><br/>"

#. module: theme_notes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_notes.s_text_cover
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Showcase your band’s music and updates online with a user-friendly "
"platform that simplifies everything, from setup to track management, making "
"it easy for fans to discover and enjoy your sound.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Predstavite glasbo in novosti svoje skupine na spletu z uporabniku "
"prijazno platformo, ki poenostavi vse, od nastavitve do upravljanja skladb, "
"ter oboževalcem olajša odkrivanje in uživanje v vaši glasbi.<br/>"

